# Private capability actions, not customer endpoints.
# Obtain originalRequest and fresh signed delegatedContext from the governed AIR owner.
# A matching client workload certificate is also required. Do not run without activation authorization.
@baseUrl = https://business-platform.internal.waooaw
@delegatedContext = replace-with-fresh-route-and-body-bound-envelope
@originalRequest = replace-with-original-InferenceOwnerRequest-JSON
@usageRequest = replace-with-original-request-plus-reservationId-inputTokens-outputTokens-JSON
@releaseRequest = replace-with-original-request-plus-reservationId-JSON
@contentReadRequest = replace-with-original-InferenceOwnerRequest-and-persisted-fresh-owner-permission-JSON

### Resolve the original agent-specific admitted binding
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/conversation-inference/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{delegatedContext}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{originalRequest}}

### Fresh owner content read; requires a separate route/body-bound recovery envelope
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/conversation-inference/read-content
Authorization: Bearer {{delegatedContext}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{contentReadRequest}}

### Reserve through the combined messaging/model owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/conversation-inference/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{delegatedContext}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{originalRequest}}

### Settle full reported usage, including overruns
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/conversation-inference/settle
Authorization: Bearer {{delegatedContext}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{usageRequest}}

### Recover only the original financial receipt, without reserving or dispatching again
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/conversation-inference/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{delegatedContext}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{originalRequest}}

### Release a known pre-provider-dispatch failure only
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/conversation-inference/release
Authorization: Bearer {{delegatedContext}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{releaseRequest}}

### Missing delegated authority must be rejected; never triggers generation
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/conversation-inference/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{}
